OL,3,GNEWSAFour arrested after vehicle
OL,4,Acrashes during chase
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour men have been arrested after a
OL,7,Fvehicle crashed into a central
OL,8,Freservation in Scunthorpe during a
OL,9,Fchase.
OL,11,FA spokesperson for the Metropolitan
OL,12,FPolice said it failed to stop for
OL,13,Fofficers on the A18 on Sunday at 09:20
OL,14,FBST.
OL,16,FThe vehicle was being chased before the
OL,17,Fcrash, in which there were no reported
OL,18,Finjuries. The Met said it was carrying
OL,19,Fout "a proactive operation" in
OL,20,FScunthorpe, with the assistance of
OL,21,FHumberside Police.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
